# Test suite
#
# Compiled test binaries are the test_* entries with no extension, so
# ignore the lot and add the source forms back.  Enumerating the
# binaries instead means every new test needs a line here, and one
# forgotten line commits a binary.
/tests/test_*
!/tests/test_*.c
!/tests/test_*.h
!/tests/test_*.sh
/tests/*.log
/tests/*.trs

